---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | Country Roofing & Construction LLC"
  description="Terms of Service for Country Roofing & Construction LLC, including terms for website use and SMS communications."
  canonical="https://countryroofingandconstruction.com/terms-of-service"
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content">
    <section class="page-hero-sm">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> July 22, 2026</p>

        <p>
          These Terms of Service govern your use of the Country Roofing &amp;
          Construction LLC website and our SMS text messaging program. By using
          our website, requesting our services, or choosing to receive text
          messages from us, you agree to these Terms of Service.
        </p>

        <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>

        <p>
          By accessing or using
          <a href="https://countryroofingandconstruction.com">
            countryroofingandconstruction.com
          </a>,
          submitting a request for services, or opting in to receive SMS text
          messages from Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC, you acknowledge
          that you have read and agree to these Terms of Service.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Our Services</h2>

        <p>
          Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC provides roofing, exterior
          renovation, repair, inspection, estimate, scheduling, and related
          construction services. Information provided through our website is
          intended for general informational and service-request purposes.
        </p>

        <p>
          Submitting a form or requesting an estimate does not create a binding
          service agreement. Specific project terms, pricing, timelines, and
          responsibilities may be provided separately in an estimate, proposal,
          or contract.
        </p>

        <h2>3. Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC SMS Program</h2>

        <p>
          If you provide your phone number and choose to receive SMS text
          messages, Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC may send you
          informational messages related to your request or services, including:
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Responses to inquiries and requests for information</li>
          <li>Appointment scheduling and reminders</li>
          <li>Estimate and inspection updates</li>
          <li>Project and service updates</li>
          <li>Customer support communications</li>
        </ul>

        <p>
          Consent to receive SMS text messages is voluntary and is not a
          condition of purchasing any goods or services.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Message Frequency</h2>

        <p>
          Message frequency varies depending on your request, your interactions
          with Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC, and the services being
          provided. You may receive recurring messages while an inquiry,
          appointment, estimate, or project is active.
        </p>

        <h2>5. Message and Data Rates</h2>

        <p>
          Message and data rates may apply. Charges are determined by your
          wireless carrier and mobile service plan. Country Roofing &amp;
          Construction LLC is not responsible for any messaging or data charges
          assessed by your carrier.
        </p>

        <h2>6. Opting Out and Getting Help</h2>

        <p>
          You may stop receiving SMS text messages at any time by replying
          <strong>STOP</strong> to any message from Country Roofing &amp;
          Construction LLC. After you send <strong>STOP</strong>, you may receive
          a confirmation message, and no additional SMS messages will be sent
          unless you opt in again.
        </p>

        <p>
          For assistance with the SMS program, reply
          <strong>HELP</strong> to any message or contact us using the
          information in the Contact Us section below.
        </p>

        <h2>7. Supported Carriers and Message Delivery</h2>

        <p>
          SMS delivery depends on your wireless carrier, device, network
          availability, and other factors outside our control.
          <strong>
            Carriers are not liable for any delayed or undelivered messages.
          </strong>
        </p>

        <h2>8. Privacy</h2>

        <p>
          Your privacy is important to us. Our collection, use, storage, and
          sharing of personal information, including phone numbers and SMS
          consent information, is described in our
          <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>9. Website Information and Availability</h2>

        <p>
          We make reasonable efforts to keep the information on our website
          accurate and current, but we do not guarantee that all content will
          always be complete, accurate, or available. We may update, remove, or
          modify website content and services at any time.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are not responsible for interruptions caused by maintenance,
          technical issues, third-party services, network failures, or events
          outside our reasonable control.
        </p>

        <h2>10. Third-Party Links</h2>

        <p>
          Our website may contain links to third-party websites or services.
          Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC does not control and is not
          responsible for the content, availability, privacy practices, or terms
          of those third-party websites.
        </p>

        <h2>11. Changes to These Terms</h2>

        <p>
          We may update these Terms of Service from time to time to reflect
          changes in our services, business practices, legal obligations, or SMS
          program requirements. Updated terms will be posted on this page with a
          revised effective date.
        </p>

        <p>
          Your continued use of our website or SMS program after updated terms
          are posted means that you accept the revised Terms of Service.
        </p>

        <h2>12. Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
          For questions about these Terms of Service, our services, or our SMS
          messaging program, please contact us:
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Country Roofing &amp; Construction LLC</strong><br />
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:269country@gmail.com">269country@gmail.com</a><br />
          Phone:
          <a href="tel:+12693033604">(269) 303-3604</a>
        </p>

        <p>
          <em>These Terms of Service were last updated on July 22, 2026.</em>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero-sm {
    background: var(--color-dark);
    color: var(--color-white);
    padding: 6rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .page-hero-sm h1 {
    color: var(--color-white);
  }

  .prose {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.35rem;
  }

  .prose p {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .prose ul {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  .prose li {
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .prose a {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
</style>